      "problem": "On a certain day in December $2019,$ the temperature in Toronto (Ontario) was $-{7.4}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$ That same day, the temperature in Seattle (Washington) was ${3.6}^{∘}\\,\\text{C}.$ How many degrees higher was Seattle's temperature compared to the temperature in Toronto?",
